The answer path decides first whether anything was gathered [1].

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  a(["Answer()"]) --> b{"sources empty?"}
  b -->|"yes"| c(["NothingFound"])
  b -->|"no"| d["Stream to the model"]
  d --> e["Renumber markers"]
  e --> f(["Answer stored"])
```

The stored text is what the reader watched being written [1][2].
